## §6 Theme contrast on Android (common bug) **[core]**

Light themes break tutorial copy if overrides are missing.

**Symptom:** `.tut-goal-line`, `.tut-rule-line`, `.dot` stay white on Zen Sand cream → invisible.

**Fix pattern:**

```css
[data-theme="zen"] .tut-goal-line { color: #4527A0; }
[data-theme="zen"] .tut-rule-line { color: #5A4D3E; }
[data-theme="zen"] .dot { background: rgba(61,46,31,.2); }
[data-theme="zen"] .dot.on { background: #3D2E1F; }
```

**Before Play release:** cycle all five themes on device; verify tutorial, pager dots, headers, and win overlays.

