## §9 Verification before ship **[core]**

```bash
# WebView game (Equalize pattern)
gradle :app:assembleDebug :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest
gradle :app:connectedDebugAndroidTest

# Capacitor site
npm run build && npx cap copy android
```

Manual on device:

- [ ] Cold start offline (airplane mode)
- [ ] All **five themes** readable (especially Zen tutorial text)
- [ ] Back button exits overlays → game → tutorial → app
- [ ] Launcher icon matches Play listing 512×512 **32-bit PNG** (same art, adaptive foreground aligned)
- [ ] Screenshots match Balance (default) UI
- [ ] No keyboard/hover-only controls; touch and safe-area layout verified
- [ ] Haptic feedback on core interactions (where supported)
- [ ] Daily Challenge + share loop wired (§12) if puzzle/logic game

