## §10 Distribution channels (keep in sync) **[core]**

| Channel | Entry | Sync |
|---------|-------|------|
| GitHub Pages / canonical web | `equalize.html` | Git push |
| Educational embed (iframe) | `public/games/<id>/` | Manual vendor copy + CDN purge |
| Android | WebView assets | Gradle sync or Capacitor copy |

Web repo is **source of truth**. Android is a packaging layer — never fork gameplay in Kotlin.

