## §12 Viral & Meta-Layer Architecture **[growth]**

Every puzzle/logic game ported to mobile must include hooks for organic growth and retention:

- **The Wordle Engine (Daily Seed):** The game architecture MUST support a Daily Challenge mode. Use a deterministic procedural generation algorithm seeded by the current date (`YYYYMMDD`) so all users globally play the exact same level every 24 hours.
- **1-Tap Share Loop:** Implement the native mobile Web Share API (`navigator.share`). When a user beats a Daily Challenge, automatically generate a text-based emoji grid (e.g., 🟩 🟨 ⬛) of their gameplay and prompt them to share it to WhatsApp/Twitter.

